<title>JAPAN: Wako Electric -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Wako Electric -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 10.65		vs	   11.52</p>
<p> Operating	  657    million	  vs	  731    million</p>
<p> Current	    639    million	  vs	  724    million</p>
<p> Net		  275    million	  vs	  354    million</p>
<p> EPS		   21.30 yen	  vs	   27.45 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     13 million	  vs	  13 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Wako Electric Co Ltd is a manufacturer of semiconductors.</p>
</text>
